":"Yuri","familyname":"Mazei","contactname":"Mazei, Yuri"}],"datasettype":"testate amoebae surface sample","datasetnotes":null,"recdatecreated":"2019-08-05T17:23:36"}]}},{"site":{"siteid":26162,"sitename":"Fleet Moss","sitedescription":"Exposed upland area of blanket bog with areas of degradation including gullying and sheet erosion. The area has no conservation designations and is utilised in places as rough grazing for sheep, with evidence of past gripping (drain cutting) to reduce the water table and favour dwarf shrub and grass species. Vegetation is typical of grazed blanket peat with abundant Poaceae amongst a mosaic of C. vulgaris and Eriophorum spp. Bryophyte cover is locally abundant and diverse with the Sphagna S. capillifolium, S. cuspidatum, S. papillosum, and Hypnum jutlandicum, H. cupressiforme, Aulacomnium palustre and Racomitrium lanuginosum occurring frequently throughout.","sitenotes":null,"geography":"{\"type\":\"Point\",\"crs\":{\"type\":\"name\",\"properties\":{\"name\":\"EPSG:4326\"}},\"coordinates\":[-2.2094,54.24639]}","altitude":565,"collectionunitid":32353,"collectionunit":"FM118","handle":"FM_FM118","unittype":"Modern","datasets":[{"doi":["10.21233/0017-2n24"],"agerange":[{"units":"Calendar years BP","ageold":-62,"ageyoung":-62}],"database":"Neotoma Testate Amoebae Database","datasetid":45540,"datasetpi":[{"initials":"A.","contactid":6308,"firstname":"Antony","familyname":"Blundell","contactname":"Blundell, Antony"},{"initials":"A.A.","contactid":14022,"firstname":"Anatoly A","familyname":"Bobrov","contactname":"Bobrov, Anatoly A"},{"initials":"B.G.","contactid":105,"firstname":"Barry G.","familyname":"Warner","contactname":"Warner, Barry G."},{"initials":"D.J.","contactid":7252,"firstname":"Daniel J.","familyname":"Charman","contactname":"Charman, Daniel J."},{"initials":"E.A.D.","contactid":9337,"firstname":"Edward A. D.","familyname":"Mitchell","contactname":"Mitchell, Edward A. D."},{"initials":"G.","contactid":7272,"firstname":"Gunnar